{
  "bodyHash": "8a30ec48c77b9b83",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:24px;color:#f00\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\">NECESSARIO GECKOLIB 4.4.2!</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:24px;color:#f00\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\">NECESSARIA A CORREÇÃO DE ATRIBUTOS!</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#808080\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\">\"Algo aconteceu... as almas antigas... acordaram... novamente.\"</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#808080;font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\">The Awakening of Elder Souls é um mod criado com a premissa de ser o melhor que posso fazer :D</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#808080;font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\">O que temos aqui? Novos monstros? Claro! Novos chefes com músicas personalizadas? Claro! Novos minérios, itens e mecânicas personalizadas? Claro! E muito mais virá!</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#e03e2d;font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\"><strong style=\"font-family:sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\">CHEFES DE ABERTURA DE EXPANSÃO</span></strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">- O Deus Máquina Antigo -</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/962250/description_d3bfc4f0-4e19-49aa-8def-c60a007930db.gif\" width=\"422\" height=\"422\"></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif;color:#808080\">O Deus Máquina Antigo é o chefe da Expansão das Máquinas. Ele pode ser encontrado no Santuário Antigo da Máquina, apenas no bioma Badlands. Sua recompensa por derrotá-lo é a Rust Blade, uma espada indestrutível com 25 de dano de ataque.</span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"color:#808080\"><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><strong>- O Barão dos Dragões -</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/962250/description_717e9fe9-46ef-4798-8ad8-5985ab7b61a0.gif\" width=\"422\" height=\"422\"></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">O Barão dos Dragões é o chefe da Expansão dos Dragões. Ele pode ser encontrado na Prisão do Barão dos Dragões, apenas no bioma Planície Nevada. Sua recompensa por derrotá-lo é o Coração do Barão dos Dragões, que é um item que, em sua mão em uso ou off-hand, lhe concede imunidade ao efeito Wither. <span style=\"color:#ba372a\">O BARÃO DOS DRAGÕES PODE TER PROBLEMAS NA VERSÃO 0.0.2</span></span></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"color:#808080\"><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><strong>- Rei do Octágono Infernal -</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/962250/description_af711976-e0f1-4680-ab76-897b05e38a62.gif\" width=\"422\" height=\"422\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">O Rei do Octágono Infernal é o chefe da Expansão dos Demônios. Ele pode ser encontrado no Octágono Infernal, apenas acima do bedrock na Floresta Vermelha. Sua recompensa por derrotá-lo são as Luvas Infernais, dois itens com efeitos diferentes. A mão direita concede Strength I quando sozinha na main hand, e Strength II quando a esquerda estiver off-hand. A mão esquerda concede Speed I quando sozinha off-hand, e Speed II quando a direita estiver main hand.</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">*Nota: Para começar a luta contra os Chefes de Abertura da Expansão, você deve usar uma Chave Mestra no Bloco de Iniciamento de Batalha correspondente.</span></strong></p>\n</div>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#e03e2d\"><strong style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><strong>CAPÍTULO 1: O ECLIPSE - GUIA COMPLETO</strong></strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\">- O Monumento Sol e Lua -</span></strong></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif;color:#808080\">Começando o Capítulo 1, você deve procurar a primeira estrutura: o Monumento Sol e Lua. Lá você encontrará os Protetores Escolhidos do Sol/Lua que precisam ser matados. Com 50% de chance, você pode pegar Peças do Sol/Lua, pegue pelo menos uma de cada. No centro da estrutura, você encontrará um monumento sol/luas. No topo dele haverá um baú, onde você encontrará a Peça da Chave do Santuário Sol/Lua. <strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">Com ela e as peças do Sol/Lua, você pode criar a Chave do Santuário Sol/Lua.</strong></span></span></strong></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/962250/description_a2e21c87-eff0-47e8-bd55-97afcb94cf2b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"309\" height=\"174\"><img style=\"font-family:sans-serif;font-size:16px\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/962250/description_b15a9c77-177e-4217-b0a9-c1242f0fc4c5.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"232\" height=\"108\"></span></strong></span></h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\">- O Santuário Sol e Lua -</span></strong></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"color:#808080;font-family:trebuchet ms, geneva, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Agora, com a Chave do Santuário Sol e Lua, você deve procurar o Santuário Sol e Lua. Uma vez encontrado, você deve passar por três estágios: O Labirinto, O Parkour Ácido e O Salão do Eclipse. No Salão do Eclipse e com a Chave do Santuário Sol e Lua, você deve ativar o Iniciador de Batalha do Guardião do Eclipse, iniciando a luta com o Guardião do Eclipse. Derrote-o e você receberá o Rune do Eclipse, a chave do Portal do Eclipse.</strong></span></span></p>\n<p><strong style=\"color:#808080;font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/962250/description_75e293be-0bf7-48b1-98a4-277f31fee72b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"268\" height=\"151\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/962250/description_09f77cad-f60a-4a5e-ae1b-f20944de27b0.png\" width=\"268\" height=\"151\"><strong style=\"color:#808080;font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/962250/description_c4fc43d1-69f5-4500-a4eb-a7d9ca1e56c4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"269\" height=\"151\"></strong><span style=\"color:#808080;font-family:trebuchet ms, geneva, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/962250/description_67f7f56b-e773-436b-8008-b44cc26e168d.png\" width=\"268\" height=\"151\"></strong></span></span></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\">- O Eclipse -</span></strong></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"color:#808080;font-family:trebuchet ms, geneva, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Uma vez na dimensão Eclipse, você receberá o efeito Imunidade a Sol e Lua por 10 minutos. Quando terminar, e você não tiver nenhum Amuleto, você sofrerá efeitos maliciosos dependendo do bioma em que estiver. Se for um bioma do Sol, você将获得 Lumus; se for bioma da Lua, você将获得 Obscurus. Para obter um Amuleto, você necessita do bronze para o da Sol, safira para o da Lua e um Olho do End.</strong></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#808080;font-family:trebuchet ms, geneva, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>MAIS DETALHES SERÃO ESCREVIDOS POSTERIORMENTE</strong></span></span></p>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#e03e2d\"><strong style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif\">VÍDEOS TUTORIAIS:</span></strong></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif;color:#808080\"><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/mqjuQolKCbY\" width=\"301\" height=\"169\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Zdqsa_L2d_0\" width=\"298\" height=\"167\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></strong></p>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">A versão 0.0.7 adicionará:</strong></ul>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color:#808080;font-family:trebuchet ms, geneva, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Oráculo do Sol;</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#808080;font-family:trebuchet ms, geneva, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Buff de itens do Eclipse;</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#808080;font-family:trebuchet ms, geneva, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Catedral do Sol;</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color:#808080;font-family:trebuchet ms, geneva, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Bastão do Sol;</strong></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:'trebuchet ms', geneva, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><strong>Adicionado na versão 0.0.6:</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#808080\">Свет Ночи;</span></strong></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#808080\">Око Ночи;</span></strong></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#808080\">Дух Солнца nerfed;</span></strong></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#808080\">Ржавый Клинок исправлен и улучшен;</span></strong></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#808080\">Олени Спектрума;</span></strong></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#808080\">Полковник Солнечного Отечества;</span></strong></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#808080\">Пламенный Справедливый Символ;</span></strong></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#808080\">Арена Вечного Солнца;</span></strong></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#808080\">Ключ Солнечного Отечества;</span></strong></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#808080\">Лунная Свинья;</span></strong></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#808080\">Пламенная Комонодовая Кожа;</span></strong></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#808080\">Бронеиз пламенной Комонодовой Кожи;</span></strong></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#808080\">Земля/Луна/Солнце Имитация;</span></strong></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#808080\">Альтарь Затмения;</span></strong></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#808080\">Альтарь Затмения Земля/Луна/Солнце;</span></strong></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#808080\">Башни Затмения;</span></strong></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#808080\">Пыль Затмения;</span></strong></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#808080\">Предметы Затмения;</span></strong></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#808080\">Железный Палочка;</span></strong></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#808080\">Ключ Лунного Отечества;</span></strong></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#808080\">Герой Лунного Отечества;</span></strong></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#808080\">Непроходимая Защита Луны Правая/Левая;</span></strong></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#808080\">Бараклы Луны Королевства;</span></strong></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#808080\">Деактивированный/Активированный Лунный Реликвия;</span></strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><strong>Версия 0.0.5 добавлена:</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#808080\">Храм Солнца и Луны исправлен;</span></strong></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#808080\">Эффект Obscurus;</span></strong></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#808080\">Эффект Lumus;</span></strong></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#808080\">5 биомов затмения: Страна подсолнуха, Огненные холбы, Лес Ночи, Лунное Кристаллическое Закрытое и Забытое Затмение;</span></strong></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#808080\">Эффект иммунитета Солнца и Луны;</span></strong></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#808080\">Новые растения затмения: Огненное Растение, Огненный Куст, Горящие Виноградины, Синий Куст и Полнолуние Цветок;</span></strong></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#808080\">Ночной Кристалл;</span></strong></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#808080\">Маленькие Вулканы;</span></strong></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#808080\">Гигантские Лунные Кристаллы;</span></strong></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#808080\">Сапфировые предметы;</span></strong></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#808080\">Бронзовые предметы;</span></strong></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#808080\">Предметы Ultrarite Сапфир;</span></strong></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#808080\">Предметы Ultrarite Бронза;</span></strong></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#808080\">Солнечная Коровка;</span></strong></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#808080\">Пламенная Комонода;</span></strong></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#808080\">Солнечный Стейк;</span></strong></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#808080\">Амулет Солнца/Луны;</span></strong></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#808080\">Простой бронзовый ключ;</span></strong></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#808080\">Дух Солнца;</span></strong></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#808080\">Дух Солнца-Защитник;</span></strong></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#808080\">Пределы Святого Солнца;</span></strong></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#808080\">Голова Святого Солнца;</span></strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><strong>Версия 0.0.4 добавлена:</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#808080\">З spawning золотых существ исправлено;</span></strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#808080\">Охранник Затмения;</span></strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#808080\">Частицы Луны/Солнца;</span></strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#808080\">Кирпичи Луны/Солнца;</span></strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#808080\">Предметы Эндерита;</span></strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#808080\">Морская соль;</span></strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#808080\">Кристаллизованная Драконья Слюна;</span></strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#808080\">Аномальная Смесь;</span></strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#808080\">Предметы Ultrarite;</span></strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#808080\">Частички Луны/Солнца;</span></strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#808080\">Ключ Храма Солнца и Луны;</span></strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#808080\">Памятник Солнца и Луны;</span></strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#808080\">Концентрированная Кислота;</span></strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#808080\">Эффект Коррозии;</span></strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#808080\">Портал Затмения;</span></strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#808080\">Измерение Затмения (не работает);</span></strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#808080\">Выбранный Защитник Солнца/Луны;</span></strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#808080\">Храм Солнца и Луны (ключ не работает, будет исправлено в 0.0.5);</span></strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><strong>Версия 0.0.3 добавлена:</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#808080\">Король Инфернального Октагона;</span></strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#808080\">Инфернальные Перчатки;</span></strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#808080\">Упащенный Памятник: Выживание Дом;</span></strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#808080\">Барон Драгонов исправлен;</span></strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><strong>Версия 0.0.2 добавлена:</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#808080\">Древние Памятники Пустыни/Оксиданных Земель;</span></strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#808080\">Барон Драгонов;</span></strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#808080\">Тюрьма Барона Драгонов;</span></strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#808080\">Сердце Барона Драгонов;</span></strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#808080\">Уродливое Хозяйство;</span></strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#808080\">Демонические Контракты класса 1-2;</span></strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#808080\">Упащенный Памятник: Ферма;</span></strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#808080\">Конструкторская Палка;</span></strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#808080\">Главный Ключ;</span></strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#808080\">Золотые существа: Золотой Зомби, Золотой Крипер, Золотая Ведьма;</span></strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#808080\">Рубиновые предметы;</span></strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#808080\">Креативные Вкладки;</span></strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:18px\"><strong>Версия 0.0.1 добавлена:</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:#808080\">Изумрудные предметы;</span></strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;color:#808080\">Радужные предметы;</span></strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;color:#808080\">Древние/Полированные древние блоки;</span></strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;color:#808080\">Старинный машинный бог;</span></strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;color:#808080\">Старинное святилище машин;</span></strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&#x27;trebuchet ms&#x27;, geneva, sans-serif;color:#808080\">Ржавая сабля;</span></strong></span></li>\n</ul>",
